00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:54.310
Today, we'll be making angel 
wingtip with blue cheese.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.960
Everything's the same color!

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.830
A very black blue!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:15.090
Fifty thousand, I'd say.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.010
Gramps, you're part of the 
make-me-blue movement?

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:18.700
Stop it.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:19.800
Drop a zero.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.640
That zero might save your life.

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.300
You want this to blow up again?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.050
Tsk.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.860
Still, you're an oddball.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.310
Why would you put a GPS on a scooter?

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:36.320
With a Blu-ray player to boot.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.990
I'm at a crossroads in my life.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.750
A very blue crossroads.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.610
Don't let that Blu-ray player 
get you into an accident!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:50.470
Hey, I moved you over.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.100
You understand?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.500
You better earn me the 50 grand back.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.700
I-I'm sorry about causing 
you so much trouble.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.820
I couldn't fit on a

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:05.690
video tape because I was 
supposed to be capable

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.530
of destroying entire cities.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.370
I'm really sorry.

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.570
I will hang myself in apology.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:12.890
Uh, you already hanged yourself.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.230
Listen to me.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.670
No more hanging or wing snapping.

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.890
You're gonna pay me back 
by serving as my navigator.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.900
A fool like you should still 
be able to read a map, right?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:23.860
Th-Thank you.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:28.550
You have set me free from my cage.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:32.410
Y-You're like my wings...

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.620
I-In that case,

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.710
I no longer need this defiled wing.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.210
Stop! I told you to stop that!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.560
You really want to rip your wings off!

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.500
Take better care of your body!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.780
I feel better when I see blood,

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:52.470
because I may feel blue. 
But my blood is still red.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.590
Okay, we have our destination!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.850
Tell me the way to the hospital!

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:58.860
I'm on a delivery, so do a proper job.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.090
This is where we're going.

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.080
Bring up the map!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.990
U-Understood.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.970
The blue wing is our current location.

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:11.110
Our destination is the red wing.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:13.000
The whole screen is covered in red!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.000
Who said anything about blood?!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.190
Sorry, I wanted to help you 
calm down and drive safely.

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:20.440
How is this supposed to calm me down?!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:23.010
I can't tell where I'm 
going with all this blood!

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:26.430
You should give me a more 
realistic demonstration!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:28.890
That's not what I meant!

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.630
Like this?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.110
Yes, like this!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:36.350
And tell me stuff like how many 
meters many until a turn to the right.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.910
Turn right in 25 meters.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:46.290
Turn right in 50 meters.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.370
Turn right in 75 meters.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.600
Uh, why do I keep turning right?

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.390
I'm back where I started?

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.510
Do you know what you're doing?

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.630
I'm sorry...

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:05.080
But I only have a right wing to turn....

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.380
Nobody said to turn your wing!

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:08.630
I-I'm sorry...

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:13.150
It will be another 125 meters 
before I can snap the next bone.

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:16.010
Nobody wants to hear about 
your broken angel wing!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.510
Give me my damn directions!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.680
Y-Yes...

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:25.150
Nobody cares about me.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.920
Turn left.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:28.330
And then...

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.400
Continue forward.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.790
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.770
What do you mean?

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:40.540
If nobody cares about my 
life, I'm already dead.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.750
What a pain!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.540
This navigation system 
is a pain the ass!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.660
Y-Yes...

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.740
My navigation is too heavy.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:50.790
I am nothing but a chain on your legs.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:51.880
Goodbye.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.180
Take care.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.560
The hell are you on?! I'm riding 
on the scooter you're in!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.300
F-Fine!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.750
When this job is finished, 
I'll listen to your story!

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.350
Just give me directions right now!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.380
Focus on navigating!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.270
R-Really?

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.320
Then I'll try my best.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.280
Turn right in 150 meters.

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.330
Yes, yes. Excellent. 
That's more like it!

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.790
Turn left in 20 meters.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.180
You are too close to the 
car in front of you.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.420
Hey, you're pretty good at this.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:25.210
So turn right, turn left... What's next?

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.250
Kotatsu six kilometers behind.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.800
What does your kotatsu 
have to do with anything?!

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:30.910
You want me to turn around?!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.800
You need to go check 
if it's turned off?!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.820
Why do you keep worrying 
about your kotatsu?!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:37.210
You are too far away from the kotatsu.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:39.840
Current distance: 6,238 meters.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:42.140
Who cares how far away the kotatsu is?!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:46.020
Distance between our 
hearts: 6,343 meters.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.810
How does that even make sense?!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.880
Where is your heart?!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:53.840
So close...

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.280
And yet so far away.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.730
You are so far away...

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.490
This navigation system 
is a pain in the ass!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.830
It's like you're straight out 
of a Shinji Nojima serial!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.960
I'm just kidding! You're 
not a pain in the ass!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.460
Thank you for the concern!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.340
But don't worry, you 
turned off the kotatsu!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.390
Focus!

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:18.010
Do your job, okay?!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.060
I'm sorry.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.080
I can't stop worrying 
about the kotatsu...

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.100
Are you sure? Are you really sure?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.360
It's fine! Stop worrying.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:29.390
I'm sorry.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.650
I had a traumatic experience 
involving a kotatsu.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:34.570
Uh, could you just do your job?

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:35.510
Yes...

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:39.870
I was waiting for him that day...

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:41.660
Hey, what is this?!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.120
You're like those couples who 
get stuck in a traffic jam

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.710
and start watching shows 
on their navigation system!

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:49.920
My boyfriend was so possessive that 
he wouldn't let me go outside.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.200
Boyfriend?!

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.540
Isn't that the mad 
scientist who made you?!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.480
And is this like a flashback 
in a flashback?!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.680
When I tried to go outside,

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:02.890
he would use d-doner kebab.

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.460
Domestic violence!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:05.890
You were completely off!

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.770
And did he just rip off a wing?!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.190
You had two earlier!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:12.360
Back then, I had six wings.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.230
Hell if I care!

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:16.200
And how come you can talk straight now!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:20.200
I tried to convince myself that 
he was acting out of love.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:23.200
But there was one thing that worried me.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:28.990
My mad boyfriend would always leave me and go away...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.210
You're the one who's mad!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.550
He went to Fukuoka a while back.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.130
Last week, it was Hokkaido.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.710
Today, he went to Nagoya.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.490
Are these really business trips?

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:43.350
Or is he going to see other women?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.710
Fukuoka, Hokkaido, and Nagoya?!

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:46.980
Aren't you from a different planet?!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:49.640
I could only sit under a kotatsu and

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.800
watch reruns of Shinji 
Nojima serials while

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.030
waiting for him to return.

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.300
What the hell?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.490
Why does it have to be Shinji Nojima?!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.120
Then I woke up.

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.420
I could smell something delicious.

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:07.370
It was a gift from Nagoya.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.880
My boyfriend was really 
on a business trip!

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:13.190
And he bought a present for me.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:19.620
But then I realized that 
it wasn't a present from Nagoya.

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:24.390
It was my wing that had been burned 
by the heat from the kotatsu.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.390
Why?!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:38.650
And so, I was traumatized by 
kotatsu, wings, and Shinji Nojima.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:40.470
I-It's okay!

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:43.070
Everybody has to deal 
with their own pain!

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.200
Wh-Who cares if you 
don't have any wings?!

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.120
You don't need any wings!

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.170
I'll take you where you want to go!

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.750
<b>Really?</b>

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:07.560
Wow, the sky is so blue...

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:45.030
<b>Next Episode: So in the Second Season of Prison Break,
 They're Already Broken Out of Prison,
 But the Name Works Once You Realize That Society is a Prison</b>

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:42.630
Let me out!

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:45.030
I'm innocent!
